        "original_id": "14d5d883-57ba-5faf-9d14-442e3b9ae9bb",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Works: Sphereland, Flatland\n- People: Dionys Burger, Edwin Abbott Abbott, A Square\n- Companies: Seeley & Co.\n- Places: London\n\nFacts:\n- In 1884, Seeley & Co. of London first published Flatland: A Romance of Many Dimensions.\n- Edwin Abbott Abbott, an English schoolmaster, wrote Flatland: A Romance of Many Dimensions as a satirical novella.\n- A Square was a pen name of Edwin Abbott Abbott.\n- In 1965, Dionys Burger published Sphereland: A Fantasy About Curved Spaces and an Expanding Universe as a sequel to Flatland.",
